### 3. CSS Styling (existing `styles.css` + new styles)
```css
.alert-banner {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 1000;
  padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  border-radius: 8px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 1rem;
  animation: slideDown 0.3s ease-out;
}

.alert-banner.critical {
  background: rgba(211, 47, 47, 0.2);
  border: 2px solid #d32f2f;
  color: #fff;
}

.alert-banner .alert-icon {
  font-size: 2rem;
}

.dismiss-alert {
  margin-left: auto;
  padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  border: 1px solid #fff;
  color: #fff;
  border-radius: 4px;
  cursor: pointer;
}

#recent-anomalies-feed {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1rem;
}

.anomaly-feed-item {
  background: var(--mid-bg);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-cyan);
  padding: 1rem;
  border-radius: 4px;
}

.anomaly-feed-item.critical { border-left-color: #d32f2f; }
.anomaly-feed-item.high { border-left-color: #f57c00; }
.anomaly-feed-item.moderate { border-left-color: #fbc02d; }

.severity-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.severity-badge.critical { background: #d32f2f; color: #fff; }
.severity-badge.high { background: #f57c00; color: #fff; }
.severity-badge.moderate { background: #fbc02d; color: #000; }
